		<p>The hybrid system gauge indicates whether the current driving condition is fuel efficient or not.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p><term translate="no">CHARGE</term>:</p>
				<p>Shows that the energy made by the vehicle is converting to electrical energy (Regenerated energy).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><term translate="no">ECO</term>:</p>
				<p>Shows that you are driving the vehicle in an eco-friendly manner.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><term translate="no">POWER</term>:</p>
				<p>Shows that the vehicle is exceeding the eco-friendly range.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
